Setup
Start Node:
	∙	Add variable: person_name (String)
LLM Node:
	∙	Select your model
	∙	System Prompt:

You are a public profiling agent. When given a person's name, 
provide a detailed profile based on your training knowledge including:
- Full name and background
- Professional career and achievements
- Known affiliations and organizations
- Public activities and contributions


	∙	User Prompt:

Give me a detailed public profile of: {{start.person_name}}


End Node:
	∙	Output the LLM response

Limitation to Know



|              |LLM Node Only         |With Search Tools|
|--------------|----------------------|-----------------|
|Setup         |Very easy             |Complex          |
|Speed         |Fast                  |Slower           |
|Data freshness|Up to training cutoff |Real-time        |
|Accuracy      |Good for famous people|Better           |
|Recent news   |❌ No                  |✅ Yes            |

When This is Good Enough
	∙	For well-known public figures (politicians, CEOs, celebrities)
	∙	When you don’t need latest news
	∙	For quick prototyping

When You Need Search Too
	∙	For less known people
	∙	When you need recent events
	∙	For accurate current info

